Limits and next step
--------------------
No exact-nonce Linux N=2 replay of schema v16 has been run yet, and opt-in
capture overhead has not been benchmarked. The disabled-option path uses the
existing const-specialized code path and is covered by focused tests; no
performance claim is made. S5-07 remains blocked/unaccepted. Next, replay both
canonical source runs with the same nonces and inputs, verify full source
stop/UART/PF sequence equality, then compare entry/return/stop deltas. The
invocation interval may include interrupt/fault handlers; interval membership
does not prove those events were caused by the copy.
